  "economy": {
    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "After heavy use the Gu weakens and needs feeding; if it stays unfed and is activated too much, it may die from hunger. Treasure yellow heaven yields few sellers for that food, but Tai Bai Yun Sheng reports underworld jellyfishes already on sale in Hai Shi blessed land. Deepsea lightning eels are rarer: Gu Immortals must enter the deep sea to capture them, and the abundant sea areas are controlled by Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance.",
        "chapters": [
          679
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hunger-and-market",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_eastern_sea",
          "fac_zombie_alliance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The feed materials are covered on underworld jellyfish and deepsea lightning eels.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hunger-and-market",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_underworld_jellyfish",
          "res_deepsea_lightning_eels"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qin Bai Sheng introduces Worldly Wave Trace as a rank six Gu used for movement. Gu Immortals bid for it while the sale is still open.",
        "chapters": [
          752
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "auction-and-sale",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qin_bai_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan sells it to Fairy You Lan, and the Gu passes into Feng Jiu Ge’s hands for Spirit Affinity House.",
        "chapters": [
          754
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "auction-and-sale",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_swordmaster_you_lan",
          "char_feng_jiu_ge",
          "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "game_proposals": []
  },
  "distribution": {
    "locations": [],
    "factions": [],
    "origin": "unknown",
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "While refining control over Water Pavilion, Fang Yuan finds two assisting Immortal Gu beside the rank seven core Water Harmony Gu: rank six movement Immortal Gu Worldly Wave Trace and wisdom path Immortal Gu Delight in Water and Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          568
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "origin-and-acquisition",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_water_pavilion",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_water_harmony_gu",
          "gu_delight_in_water_and_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Water Pavilion breaks apart, Mo Yao’s will lends Worldly Wave Trace to Fang Yuan. The Gu looks like a jellyfish the size of a baby’s fist and wraps around a green grape immortal essence bead as it consumes it. Activation raises a huge wave under his feet that carries him away at high speed. It is a rank six Immortal Gu; with rank six cultivation he can activate it fully even though he is not a water path Gu Immortal.",
        "chapters": [
          641
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "origin-and-acquisition",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_mo_yao",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
